  "gradeRuleDescribe": {
    "yms_year": 114.0,
    "yms_smester": 2.0,
    "cls_id": "CB05121",
    "sub_id": "38552",
    "scr_dup": "001",
    "tpa_score_new": null,
    "tpa_score_new_en": null,
    "course_pol": "每周上課都會點名，無法到課請依照學校請假規則請假，上課不要私下聊天，干擾同學也干擾老師，要聊找老師聊。",
    "course_pol_en": "There will be roll call in class every week. If you are unable to attend class, please ask for leave according to the school's leave rules. Do not chat privately during class, as this will disturb your classmates and the teacher. If you want to talk, talk to the teacher.",
    "course_rem": "有好多好多的資源想要幫助同學們學習，學校有老師與助教，網路上更是有各式各樣的線上課程短影片，多做練習，熟能生巧，只要你想學，一定沒有克服不了的困難。",
    "course_rem_en": "There are so many resources to help students learn. There are teachers and teaching assistants in school, and there are all kinds of online course short videos on the Internet. Practice more and practice makes perfect. As long as you want to learn, there will be no difficulties that you cannot overcome.",
    "ais_meno": "<div>參加考試不作弊，積極參加小組報告的討論與製作，不抄襲複製現有報告，使用 AI 做報告誠實宣告，尊重引用資料作者的著作權，上課回應老師的問題，主動向老師提問，配合助教實習課程。</div>\n",
    "ais_meno_en": "<div>Do not cheat in exams, actively participate in the discussion and production of group reports, do not plagiarize or copy existing reports, make honest declarations when using AI in reports, respect the copyright of the authors of cited materials, respond to the teacher&#39;s questions in class, take the initiative to ask questions to the teacher, and cooperate with the teaching assistants in internship courses.</div>\n",
    "ilearn_mk": "N"
  },
